      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports an ‘imperfect continuous panel survey’ framing for online and social media data, but it does not define the term in general as an ongoing survey approach that follows the same panel of users over time rather than a one-time snapshot.",
        "The phrase ‘to track changes in public interest or opinion over time’ is broader than the source wording; the source says the framework is built around considering the data as an imperfect continuous panel survey so that meaningful insight about public interest and opinion can be extracted, not that the term itself means tracking change in that way."
